      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5927\u4E08\u592B\u3060\u3002\u4FEE\u884C\u3092\u7A4D\u3093\u3060\u8EAB\u3001\n\u3053\u306E\u7A0B\u5EA6\u306E\u5BD2\u3055\u306F\u554F\u984C\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m fine. With my training, this level of cold is nothing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306F\u5927\u4E08\u592B\u304B\uFF1F\n\u74B0\u5883\u306E\u5909\u5316\u304C\u82E6\u624B\u3068\u805E\u3044\u305F\u304C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What about you, Resna? I heard you don\u0027t handle environmental changes well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u6C17\u9063\u3044\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3054\u3056\u3044\u307E\u3059\uFF01\n\u3067\u3082\u5927\u4E08\u592B\u3067\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306E\u8863\u88C5\u3001\u3075\u308F\u3082\u3053\u3067\u3001\n\u898B\u305F\u76EE\u4EE5\u4E0A\u306B\u6E29\u304B\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you for your concern! But I\u0027m fine. This outfit is super fluffy and warmer than it looks!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5C11\u3057\u3001\u89E6\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3044\u3044\u3060\u308D\u3046\u304B\u3002\n\u2026\u2026\u3075\u308F\u3082\u3053\u3001\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u2026\u2026\u3044\u304B\u3093\u3001\n\u5922\u4E2D\u306B\u306A\u308A\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3002\u3053\u3053\u307E\u3067\u306B\u3057\u3088\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "May I... touch it? ...So fluffy and cute... No, I must control myself. That\u0027s enough."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u96EA\u5408\u6226\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093\u304B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Want to have a snowball fight!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3001\u96EA\u5408\u6226\u3057\u307E\u305B\u3093\u304B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna, want to have a snowball fight!?"
