      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u795D\u3044\u306E\u30B1\u30FC\u30AD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Star Birth Festival cake"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u306E\u518A\u5B50\u3067\u7D39\u4ECB\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3044\u308B\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u30B1\u30FC\u30AD\u3001\n\u3069\u308C\u3082\u7F8E\u5473\u3057\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3001\n\u3057\u304B\u3082\u3068\u3063\u3066\u3082\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Star Birth Festival cakes in this brochure all look delicious, and they\u0027re so cute too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304B\u3001\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\uFF01\u3000\n\u3053\u308C\u306F\u30AF\u30EA\u30FC\u30E0\u304C\u7ACB\u4F53\u7684\u306B\u76DB\u3089\u308C\u3001\n\u306C\u3044\u3050\u308B\u307F\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u304B\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "C-cute! The cream is sculpted to look like little plushies...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u3001\u3053\u3093\u306A\u3082\u306E\u2026\u2026\n\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3059\u304E\u3066\u98DF\u3079\u3089\u308C\u306A\u3044\uFF01\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is... too cute to eat!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306A\u3089\u305D\u3046\u8A00\u3046\u304B\u306A\u3063\u3066\n\u3000\u601D\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I had a feeling Juna would say that.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u308A\u304D\u308A\u3077\u306B\u5BDD\u5DFB\u304D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Puni cosplay pajamas"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u308A\u304D\u308A\u3077\u306B\u5BDD\u5DFB\u304D\u3001\u3053\u308C\u3092\u7740\u305F\u3089\n\u3077\u306B\u3068\u4EF2\u826F\u304F\u306A\u308C\u308B\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u306D\uFF01\n\u3069\u3046\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "These Puni pajamas might help you become friends with Punis! What do you think!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u3001\u79C1\u304C\u3053\u308C\u3092\u7740\u308B\u306E\u304B\uFF01\uFF1F\n\u306B\u3001\u4F3C\u5408\u3046\u3060\u308D\u3046\u304B\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "M-me, wearing these!? Would they... suit me...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306A\u3089\u3001\n\u3053\u308C\u3082\u7740\u3053\u306A\u305B\u308B\u3068\u4FE1\u3058\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I believe you could definitely pull these off, Juna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u304B\u2026\u2026\n\u306A\u3089\u3070\u3001\u3084\u3076\u3055\u304B\u3067\u306F\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is that so... Then I wouldn\u0027t be opposed..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3053\u308C\u3092\u7740\u3066\u3044\u308B\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3092\u898B\u3066\u307F\u305F\u3044\u2026\u2026\n\u3000\u3053\u306E\u53CD\u5FDC\u3001\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u305F\u3089\u672C\u5F53\u306B\n\u3000\u305D\u306E\u5185\u898B\u308C\u308B\u304B\u3082\u2026\u2026\uFF1F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I\u0027d love to see Juna wearing these... Maybe there\u0027s actually a chance...?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3055\u3063\u304D\u304B\u3089\u3001\u79C1\u306E\u597D\u307F\u306E\u3082\u306E\u3070\u304B\u308A\n\u898B\u3066\u3044\u306A\u3044\u304B\uFF1F\u3000\u4ED6\u306F\u898B\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3044\u3044\u306E\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haven\u0027t we been looking at things that suit my taste this whole time? Aren\u0027t there other things to see?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u306E\u597D\u307F\u3092\u8ABF\u67FB\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3053\u3068\u304C\n\u3000\u3070\u308C\u305F\u3089\u3001\u30D7\u30EC\u30BC\u30F3\u30C8\u4F5C\u6226\u5931\u6557\u3060\u30FC\uFF01\n\u3000\u3070\u308C\u306A\u3044\u3088\u3046\u6C17\u3092\u4ED8\u3051\u306A\u304D\u3083\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Oh no, if she figures out I\u0027m investigating her preferences, the surprise gift plan will fail! I need to be careful!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305B\u3001\u305B\u3063\u304B\u304F\u306E\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3068\u306E\n\u304A\u51FA\u304B\u3051\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089\uFF01\n\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3068\u8272\u3005\u898B\u305F\u3044\u306A\u30FC\u3063\u3066\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-well, it\u0027s a special outing with you, Juna! I just want to look at lots of different things together!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306A\u3089\u6B21\u306F\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306E\u597D\u304D\u306A\u3082\u306E\u3092\u898B\u3088\u3046\u3002\n\u3042\u305D\u3053\u306E\u672C\u5C4B\u3092\u898B\u3066\u307F\u308B\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In that case, let\u0027s look at things you like next. Shall we check out that bookstore?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\uFF1F\u3000\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3001\u4E00\u4F53\u4F55\u3092\u898B\u3066\u2026\u2026\n\u3000\u300C\u661F\u8A95\u796D\u8A18\u5FF5\u5927\u4F1A\u3001\u51FA\u5834\u8005\u53D7\u4ED8\u4E2D\uFF01\u300D\n\u3000\u2026\u2026\u5927\u4F1A\u306E\u5E83\u544A\u3060\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(? What is Juna looking at... \u0027Star Birth Festival Tournament Registration Now Open!\u0027 ...It\u0027s a tournament advertisement.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3059\u307E\u3093\u3001\u5C11\u3057\u307C\u30FC\u3063\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3063\u305F\u3002\n\u672C\u5C4B\u3078\u884C\u3053\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sorry, I spaced out for a moment. Let\u0027s head to the bookstore."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3001\u3042\u306E\u5E83\u544A\u306B\u8F09\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\n\u3000\u5927\u4F1A\u304C\u6C17\u306B\u306A\u308B\u306E\u304B\u306A\u2026\u2026\uFF1F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I wonder if Juna is interested in that tournament...?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]